{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_quartz_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_quartz_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"無需遺憾","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_quartz_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"4b2d419bc65b9dce0b73eb274b03069a17db72513c14225a0dedccb815c0ba6c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"石英曾與一家人有過短暫的相處。但突如其來的無妄之災，卻給這個小小的、溫馨的片刻，帶來了巨大的波折。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾維，你在後面跟緊我，不要被人群撞倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再堅持一下，等到了安全的地方我就給你處理傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......鎮長那個混蛋，簡直是瘋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"商店裡那麼多人，他居然也敢放火，根本不在乎大家是死是活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得你每次提到他，都說他是個惡棍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，他和他手下的那些傭兵都是一群惡棍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家平常都躲著他們，可還是會莫名其妙地被找上門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走這邊，這邊人少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，小姑娘，你先站住，跑什麼跑？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的零錢呢？嗯？有嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，大叔你還真是......這個時候還不忘找我要錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還坐在這裡，等下鎮長的人就過來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"我一老頭要啥沒啥，我怕什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個才是，害怕什麼呢？跑這麼急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"惹麻煩的也不是你們，不然能讓你們跑這麼遠？跑什麼呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾維，我們走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——終於到家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾維，讓我看下你的傷口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（還好傷得不深，先簡單處理一下，把血止住。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了腿上，你還有其他地方受傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我沒事，就是有點喘不上氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個混蛋......太可惡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真希望有一天能有人狠狠地教訓他一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，爸爸！我們回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說出了亂子，結果你們兩個偏偏這個時候不見了蹤影，急死人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼還受了傷，怎麼搞的？你們到底幹什麼去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮長發現有人背著他進私貨，不僅把人打了，還放火燒了那人的店鋪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和艾維當時就在店裡，跑出來的時候，艾維意外受了傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮長......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是提醒過你們兩個，最近不要出門，老老實實在家待著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......想買個禮物送給石英姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她馬上要走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不要解釋，你就回答我，我是不是說過，這幾天老實待在家裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......爸爸你說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"那你自己說，錯了沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我錯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大嬸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行了，艾維都受傷了，你還在兇她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大嬸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"艾維，快過來讓我看看，傷得嚴重不嚴重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒什麼事，你看！而且石英姐姐一直在保護我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大嬸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那你得好好謝謝石英姐姐，但是你更得聽你爸的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"石英姐姐，謝謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我該道歉才是，畢竟這次出門，也是因為我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皮克特大叔，對不起，給你們添麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......算了，也是多虧你在旁邊，艾維才沒出什麼大事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大嬸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石英，你明天就要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大嬸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你愛吃什麼？晚上我給你做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"石英姐姐......你不能留下來嗎？我不想你離開......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，可以讓石英姐姐留在我們家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只有明天，再多一天，好不好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小艾維，以後我一定會回來看你的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皮克特大叔，這些日子謝謝你們的照顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩了你們這麼久，我也是時候出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你別謝我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"實話說，我還巴不得你趕快走呢。艾維每天跟著你，我都擔心她會學壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"真不知道你父母怎麼會同意你一個人跑到這危險的荒野上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的母親應該也會想從家裡出來到處看看吧，不過......從來沒有機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的父親肯定不會同意，他和大叔你一樣，經常念叨著外面有多麼危險，雖然他也沒有說錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道還一個人跑出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的人，上一秒能在那些傳教的黎博利面前痛哭流涕，痛斥自己做過的那些糟糕的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"可一扭頭，就能為了手裡的一杯啤酒，桌子上的一把賭局，家裡的一頭瘤獸而鬧得你死我活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"最近鎮子周圍也經常有補給的車隊和拓荒隊被流匪襲擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮長自己就是個惡棍，警察局的老文森更是派不上用場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡什麼事情都有可能發生，也隨時都有可能發生。到時候更不會有人來幫你，明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是沒別的什麼事情，早點回家吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，也不知道現在幾點，估計也不早了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九點，對面商店的人每天差不多這個時候關門，我剛剛聽到他們搬東西的聲音了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"那你抓緊收拾完行李就休息吧，我還得去給那個老混蛋送貨......真是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"明天注意安全，早點回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九點了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照以往的時間，的確該休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想睡覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是也不知道該做什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那是父親修理屋頂時的聲音。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這下應該沒問題了，你媽媽晚上也可以好好休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石英！你在幹什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"認真點，仔細看我是怎麼弄的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些事情你以後都要開始學著做，知道嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那是上門討債的惡徒敲門的聲音。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"滾出去！誰允許你們上我們家來的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欠的錢我自然會還，但是你們誰要是敢上門來找麻煩，我絕不跟你們客氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石英，看到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你以後也要保護好你媽媽，不管是誰都不要怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不可能永遠擋在你的前面，更不會有別人來幫你，一切都要靠你自己了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死！窗戶外面這麼亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天居然起得這麼晚，太不應該了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還得......還得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不對，是有人在敲門的聲音。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石英！醒醒，快起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"父親？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拿上你的東西，快跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"艾維，你們在房間裡先別出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這是做什麼！就這麼衝進我家裡面？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"（鎮長昨晚被人襲擊了，現在到處找人發洩呢，讓我們一定要找到兇手。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"（昨晚見過鎮長的，只有你們幾個人。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"（配合一下，好不好？我也沒辦法啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"（被人襲擊了？誰膽子這麼大......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"老子敲門你不開，你還跟老子嚷嚷？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥倫比亞俚語*！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸！你沒事吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"退回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不！憑什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"退回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"就是嘛，管好你的女兒，不要給自己找麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"要是心裡沒鬼，你們有什麼可以擔心的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"真把老子惹急了，老子先把你們都殺了再查是不是你們幹的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大嬸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"艾維，聽話，去和你石英姐姐待在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大嬸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不會有事的，放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚上給鎮長送完貨物我就回來了，再也沒有出去過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"周圍的鄰居都可以作證，我們一家都在家裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"家裡除了我和我妻子，就只有這兩個小女孩，怎麼可能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂！快過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看我在這家人屋裡找到了什麼？！好重！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"把武器放下！立刻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"不要亂來，我最後一次警告你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......石英姐姐你的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（爸爸？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你拉我做什麼！石英姐姐她......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"（從現在開始，你要是不想給家裡惹上麻煩的話，就閉上嘴。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"（我很嚴肅地和你說，不要靠近她。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔！爸爸！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"文森，她只是借宿在我們家的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會忘了吧？畢竟當初是你帶她過來找我們幫忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊，是的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時看她一個人怪可憐的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也是看她是個小姑娘才同意的，也不會去想那麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"所以具體她是什麼身份，我們一概不知，也的確沒有問過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"（對不起，孩子。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和他們無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不認識他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（那是我心臟劇烈跳動的聲音。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工頭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到了嗎？這就是鬧事的下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工頭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們要是還想繼續在這裡工作，想掙錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工頭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那不該過問的事情不要問，不該管的事情不要管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工頭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（那是母親越來越模糊不清的心跳聲。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽，生日快樂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是爸爸之前答應要送你的禮物，我終於買到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥倫比亞俚語*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......別打了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你看她都沒動靜了......萬一真打死了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......輪不著你過問這事，我們先去找鎮長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子，把她看住了。要是讓她跑了，你知道後果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘？小姑娘？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......嚇死我了，我還以為你真死了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得......你叫石英是吧？我沒記錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石英，沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"實話說，你一個人在外面，到處都是危險，身上帶把武器我能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"可偏偏就撞上這麼個事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要我說啊，肯定不是你做的，畢竟真要說誰要對那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"（對那個老混蛋動手，那也輪不到你這個外人。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論發生什麼，無論結果如何......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都能接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我也不知道該去哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"無論什麼後果你都能接受？你嘴上倒是說得輕鬆，那你家裡人呢？你父母呢？你覺得他們能接受嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道你從哪裡來，萬一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"就說萬一有點什麼......就算我想告訴你家裡人，都不知道該找誰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等之後，我會自己去找他們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你還想跑啊？欺負我老頭子是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"外面還有那麼多人，你怎麼跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......說句實話......你要真跑了......我也不知道該著急還是該開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"想想也知道......大家這會兒肯定都在罵我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"可我也有家人......就算我知道不是你做的......我不敢啊......對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"我想皮克特他也是一樣的吧......雖然也輪不到我說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"真的對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說完了嗎？我在旁邊都聽煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說了半天，不就是你知道不是她幹的，你也很同情她，可就是什麼也不敢做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？！你怎麼進來了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"你想做什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來找她的，不是來找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"你先休息一下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老警察文森","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒想到居然會牽連到你，唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面那麼多人，你怎麼進來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"外面？外面已經亂成一片了，你不知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，在放你走之前......你有沒有興趣加入我們？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，鎮長怎麼把所有人都叫到這裡來了啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他又想做什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個跟緊我，不要走散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，為什麼所有人都這麼怕他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明我們人數這麼多。把他趕跑不行嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"艾維，算爸爸求你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我求你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"聽話行嗎？我不想你有個三長兩短。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一家人在一起，一定會沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"你相信爸爸，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"光抓到兇手沒有用，既然有一個人敢對我動手，那一定就會有第二個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"說明我還是對某些人太寬容了，他們開始動歪心思了，這是不能容忍的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"再說抓到人又怎麼樣？我傷又沒好，氣也沒有消。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"要我們做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"把這次接受調查的那幾家的人，連著那兩家敢背著我進貨的商人一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"把他們都關起來，誰不老實就塞到拓荒隊去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"不過每家得留一個人在鎮子上，這樣就不怕其他人會趁機逃跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_176","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他們有軟肋，就一定會聽話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋！你們要做什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我們又不是感染者，憑什麼要被送到拓荒隊去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛你留在鎮子上，你女兒和你老婆被送過去；要麼你女兒留下，你和你老婆去拓荒隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"聽明白了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能......我自己去拓荒隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我女兒和我妻子留下，求你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"沒得商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"只能留一個人在鎮子上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們！你們太過分了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"踩點的時候被發現，所以就揍了鎮長一頓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是流匪吧？最近鎮子周圍的幾次襲擊都是你們做的，現在盯上了這個鎮子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"流匪，通緝犯，罪犯......隨便你怎麼稱呼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是一群被逼上絕路的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我們盯上的不是鎮子，而是這個鎮長，以及像他一樣的那些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮子上的其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬧出這麼大的事情，很多人都會受此牽連，還有那些無辜的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......你怎麼也跟他們一樣婆婆媽媽的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是要找上面的人討個說法，又不是要當那種懲惡揚善的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人懦弱，他們膽小，他們事不關己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"他們咎由自取。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"顧慮、擔心、害怕，做什麼都想那麼多的話，那就乾脆什麼都別做了，這樣最安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的人也最聽話了，不是嗎？有顧慮，不敢去做，所以這裡的人都怕那個鎮長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"可我不怕他，我一個老乞丐無家無業的，我怕什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"他罵我罵得那麼難聽，我肯定揍他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"除非他殺了我，可他打不過我，所以我還是要揍他，可惜被他跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"他打不過我，所以只能拿你們這些人發洩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"你想想，難道不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"你因為恪守規則而無法動彈，而那些無法無天的人，卻可以隨意踩在你的頭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，又有何妨呢？怕什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是做一個“壞人”，又怎麼樣呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說話真不像一個乞丐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"可我卻被迫成了一名乞丐，而你現在也成了流浪者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果我選擇不加入你們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"隨時可以離開，繼續你的旅途，我當然不會勉強你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"我送你出去，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"艾維！你幹什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"把你手上的武器放下！你別傷到自己！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你最好聽你爸爸的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"傷到自己不要緊，想想你的爸爸媽媽，想想他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"想想你要跟我們動手的話，他們的下場是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"誰也不願意發生太難看的事情，對吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"艾維，你不要幹傻事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們一家人在一起，一切都會解決的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我們一家人不會再在一起了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管誰去拓荒隊，誰留在鎮上，一家人終究是要分開的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰又知道接下來會發生什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想通了，這樣下去無論如何是不會有什麼好結果的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以最壞又能怎樣呢？你們要殺了我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那爸爸，如果我死了，你會替我報仇嗎？你還會有所顧慮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮克特大叔","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"艾維！你說什麼胡話呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是要動手嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來啊！來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"給我去死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"石英姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾維","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥倫比亞俚語*！你是怎麼跑出來的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"文森那個混蛋在哪裡！他想不想活了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要去找了，我會把你們都解決掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後把鎮長那個混蛋也揪出來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵A&傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"......是那個女孩吧，你把她當成妹妹的那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾維，她是個勇敢的女孩，還有皮克特大叔，他們其實不是壞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我並不想承認，但如果換作是我，回到多年以前，恐怕也會做和他們一樣的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為害怕惹惱了某些人而傷害到我的父親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為害怕沒錢給母親治病，而努力遵守時間，努力工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到失去一切都不知道自己哪裡做錯了。明明自己做了一切他們要求做的事情，明明自己做了一切對的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懊悔、沮喪，甚至開始責怪那個讓自己有所顧慮的人，覺得如果不是因為他，自己一定會有勇氣去做不一樣的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在還有彌補遺憾的機會，和我們一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"這一切本就不是你的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是我錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在看到艾維的時候，我突然明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實可以做截然不同的選擇，我其實只是在為曾經的膽小懦弱不斷找藉口而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實......有人牽掛，是一件多麼值得珍惜的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像皮克特大叔有他心愛的女兒，文森爺爺有他的小孫女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可恥的懦弱，但絕不是可悲的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老乞丐","speakerId":"avg_npc_181","isRemote":false,"text":"你想去幫她？那麼多傭兵，你準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，你忘了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你一樣，我只有一個人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"石英","speakerId":"avg_4063_quartz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕什麼呢？拼一把嘍！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
